  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A Happy Meal - Mullaitivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With the current economic crisis in Sri Lanka and high inflation more and more families are cutting down on their meals. Parents find it hard to pack food into their preschooler&apos;s lunchbox. In the past several months we have seen children bring less food to their preschool. Since last year World Vision Lanka (WVL) has supported nearly 5000 children across 17 locations in Sri Lanka. WVL is now fundraising to provide a nutritious meal for at least 100 preschool children in Mullaitivu for 6 months.</narrative>
  </description>
